WEBVTT

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:11.710
Hey. Come on.

00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:13.540
I know, man. I'm looking.

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:14.780
Well hurry it up.

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:17.780
Just shut up and keep an eye out.

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:19.880
Damn. What's this crap?

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:22.590
They've only got useless junk.

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:25.280
Seriously? Well that sucks.

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:33.400
H-Hey...

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.430
We should book it outta here.

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:37.930
I've gotta bad feeling about sticking around.

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:39.600
Quit being such a wimp.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:42.540
The capital's a complete mess right now.

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:47.640
No one's going to waste their time coming out here to stop us.

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:48.710
Huh?

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:50.110
What's wrong?

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:11.830
<i>In the city without love</i> <i>only your smile remains.</i>

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.830
<i>Hold me tight to crush the loneliness,</i> <i>it's all that stops these pains.</i>

00:01:22.450 --> 00:01:32.250
<i>You're constrained by that limit.</i>
<i>Free yourself and break apart the chains.</i>

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:42.250
<i>It's all gonna burn on down.</i>
<i>Dance to the flames that consume the night.</i>

00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:52.430
<i>The inferno rages on. It's almost</i> <i>as beautiful as you. Beautiful and bright.</i>

00:01:58.280 --> 00:02:02.950
<i>Dance to the end of the night.</i>

00:02:02.950 --> 00:02:12.950
<i>The inferno rages on. It's almost</i> <i>as beautiful as you. Beautiful and bright. Dance!</i>

00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:23.470
<i>In the city without love</i>

00:02:39.020 --> 00:02:41.690
That's the last of our dwindling rations!

00:02:41.690 --> 00:02:45.860
If you take it away, the whole village will starve!

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:47.420
Shut up! Outta the way!

00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:50.930
Please, spare us!

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:52.670
Listen here...

00:02:52.670 --> 00:02:55.740
From today forth, this village belongs to me.

00:02:55.740 --> 00:02:57.710
What does he mean by that?

00:02:57.710 --> 00:03:01.240
Just wait! When the king finds out about this...

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:05.080
You fools. Do none of you know that King Delzaine is dead?

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:05.950
Impossible...

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:07.280
King Delzaine...

00:03:07.280 --> 00:03:09.950
What will become of this kingdom?

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:13.390
Come on, load it all up.

00:03:13.390 --> 00:03:16.120
Once we're done here, we'll head straight to the next village.

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:19.460
W-What?!

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:21.230
Who's there?!

00:03:21.230 --> 00:03:23.970
It's about time someone put an end to this.

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:28.970
You must be one pitiful lord to raid a tiny village like this.

00:03:28.970 --> 00:03:31.440
Bah. You bastard...

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:33.880
What are you waiting for? Get them!

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:37.240
Ignauts, attack!

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:50.890
You all right?

00:03:50.890 --> 00:03:53.230
If you're scared, you can hide behind my back.

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:56.130
Shut up! That was gonna be my line!

00:04:13.780 --> 00:04:17.620
You're even watching me during a fight? That's dedication.

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:19.990
I still don't quite trust you.

00:04:19.990 --> 00:04:22.460
If you do anything suspicious, you're dead.

00:04:22.460 --> 00:04:23.530
Come, this way!

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:24.960
Hurry!

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:31.130
Time to scram!

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:32.470
They're getting away!

00:04:32.470 --> 00:04:34.370
Give it up.

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:35.500
Demetrio?

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:37.370
No point in chasing.

00:04:37.370 --> 00:04:39.670
Get everyone able to help the injured.

00:04:40.180 --> 00:04:45.050
"15: Monster"

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:49.850
Thanks for the meal!

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:54.390
Sadly, such a meager meal isn't enough to satiate.

00:04:54.390 --> 00:04:56.790
We're very thankful for the food.

00:04:56.790 --> 00:05:02.360
No... It is we who are thankful that you came to help.

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:07.170
No problem! The Ignauts live to save and help those in need.

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:11.040
You talk awful big for someone who only just joined.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:13.880
But you're no different than me, don't you forget!

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:16.540
No... I joined before you did.

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:21.350
True. Emilio was the one who joined first.

00:05:21.350 --> 00:05:24.820
He was ahead by how long it takes to say Endora chicken.

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:26.860
That's like the same time!

00:05:26.860 --> 00:05:28.720
It still makes me your senior.

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:34.530
Ignauts? If the rumors
I've heard are true, then--

00:05:34.530 --> 00:05:38.430
Yeah. We were previously a revolutionary army.

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:44.410
But now, we march for the capital, quelling the chaos in Endora as we go.

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:45.940
I see...

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:49.550
So you mean, the same is happening elsewhere?

00:05:49.550 --> 00:05:52.580
Yes. Ever since King Delzaine was killed...

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:58.450
...the disorder in the capital has spread to the far reaches of Endora.

00:05:58.450 --> 00:06:01.220
With the kingdom's authority falling apart...

00:06:01.220 --> 00:06:06.430
...regional lords are taking advantage of the situation and expanding their territories by force.

00:06:06.430 --> 00:06:09.430
But don't worry. This village is safe now.

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:12.270
We chased all the bad guys away.

00:06:12.270 --> 00:06:14.740
That's not how it works.

00:06:14.740 --> 00:06:16.540
Huh? Why not?

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:18.410
The embers still burn.

00:06:18.410 --> 00:06:19.580
Embers?

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:21.980
It's true you saved us today...

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:28.980
But once you leave, who knows when those villains will return.

00:06:28.980 --> 00:06:35.560
True. I doubt they will behave just from being thwarted this once.

00:06:35.560 --> 00:06:40.000
But I thought there were Ignauts working all over the kingdom.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:45.100
There are, but we can't stop the turmoil across the entirety of Endora.

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:48.740
Then what do you plan on doing?!

00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:53.110
It's pointless to try and solve things using force.

00:06:53.110 --> 00:06:54.510
Hmm?

00:06:57.610 --> 00:07:04.150
With the king's death in Babylon, the people are suffering from his loss.

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:05.150
Emilio...

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:08.690
Hey now. Are you still caught up on Delzaine?

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:11.760
I thought you decided not to whine about it anymore.

00:07:11.760 --> 00:07:13.600
I'm not whining.

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:17.170
I'm thinking about the future.

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:21.670
Right now, the people of the kingdom have nothing to believe in.

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:25.170
They're lacking a figure to lead them towards a better future.

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:28.140
A figure to lead them, eh?

00:07:28.140 --> 00:07:31.670
If only a person like you became king.

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:34.280
No, I mean...

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:40.190
A person like you who truly values and tries to understand the people of the kingdom.

00:07:40.190 --> 00:07:44.390
Someone like that is fit to be the king of Endora.

00:07:44.390 --> 00:07:46.030
I...

00:07:46.030 --> 00:07:49.000
Please forgive what I've said.

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:51.560
No... It's fine.

00:07:54.470 --> 00:07:57.410
Bah... This really pisses me off.

00:07:57.410 --> 00:08:02.900
With the king gone, this is the perfect chance to amass land of my own.

00:08:05.410 --> 00:08:09.820
Every minute I sit here, the other lords are taking what should be mine!

00:08:09.820 --> 00:08:12.860
Captain! Where's my captain?!

00:08:12.860 --> 00:08:14.260
Captain!

00:08:17.030 --> 00:08:19.860
Listen here! Gather all the weapons you can find!

00:08:19.860 --> 00:08:23.070
Quickly now! Tell the soldiers at once!

00:08:23.070 --> 00:08:26.000
Go and attack as soon as they're ready!

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:28.270
Hmph! Ignauts my ass!

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:32.370
They're just a bunch of wild thugs rebelling against my true authority.

00:08:32.370 --> 00:08:35.040
I'll show them who's boss.

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:36.350
What's your problem?

00:08:36.350 --> 00:08:40.010
What are you standing around for? Get moving!

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:53.430
S-S-Someone help!

00:08:53.430 --> 00:08:55.420
Help me!

00:08:57.230 --> 00:08:59.470
Can't anyone hear me?!

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:02.270
Hate them that much, do you?

00:09:02.270 --> 00:09:04.940
You... Who are you?!

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:07.270
How about I lend you a hand?

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:15.580
You want to go visit that lord?

00:09:15.580 --> 00:09:18.950
Yes. It's just like the elder said.

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:25.460
Once we leave this village, that lord will attack again without remorse.

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:26.960
We don't have time for this.

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:31.330
We need to unite with Gradido and the others as quickly as possible.

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:34.670
He's right. We need to hurry back to the capital.

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:38.570
Emilio. What do you even intend to do there?

00:09:38.570 --> 00:09:40.480
Well...

00:09:40.480 --> 00:09:42.410
I want to talk with him.

00:09:42.410 --> 00:09:43.850
Talk?

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:46.940
Ever since leaving Babylon, I've been thinking.

00:09:47.950 --> 00:09:52.150
What can I possibly do to better the kingdom?

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:57.130
Yesterday, I realized something talking to the elder.

00:09:57.130 --> 00:10:00.030
That there's still so much that I don't know.

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:04.670
So, to fix that, I need to speak with and understand as many people as I can.

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:08.100
But do you really think he'll listen to anything you say?

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:11.970
Those brutes from yesterday can't be reasoned with.

00:10:11.970 --> 00:10:17.350
I know! If you need to, you could say "Do you know who you're speaking with?!"

00:10:17.350 --> 00:10:19.350
and show 'em the king's seal.

00:10:19.350 --> 00:10:23.320
They'll say "My lord!" and grovel before you...

00:10:23.320 --> 00:10:25.520
What are you even talking about?

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:30.390
I mean, aren't you basically the successor of Delzaine?

00:10:30.390 --> 00:10:31.960
That's...

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:35.500
Through inheritance of the throne, he might be right.

00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:40.000
So you can show 'em the seal and get "My Lord!", right?

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:44.470
What's with you and this seal and "My Lord"?

00:10:44.470 --> 00:10:47.680
Fine. I have no problem with you seeing the lord.

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:49.580
Thank you, Demetrio.

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:52.410
However, I'm going as well. All right?

00:10:52.410 --> 00:10:53.480
I understand.

00:10:53.480 --> 00:10:54.880
Then I'm going, too.

00:10:56.020 --> 00:10:59.490
If you don't trust me, why don't you all just come, too?

00:10:59.490 --> 00:11:02.490
No. We need to limit our numbers.

00:11:02.490 --> 00:11:05.690
Any more and they'll feel threatened.

00:11:10.670 --> 00:11:12.600
Why did you have to come?

00:11:12.600 --> 00:11:15.900
If you're scared, you can hide behind my back.

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:18.070
Yeah, whatever.

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:19.040
Is this it?

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:20.840
It appears so.

00:11:23.710 --> 00:11:27.420
It's huge! How many rooms do you think it has?!

00:11:27.420 --> 00:11:30.950
We didn't come here to scope out your new home.

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:34.260
But seriously, why is it like nobody's here?

00:11:34.260 --> 00:11:38.230
I'd've thought there'd be soldiers lined up in a neat big row.

00:11:38.230 --> 00:11:42.190
True, I don't sense the presence of anyone inside.

00:11:43.270 --> 00:11:44.530
What's wrong?

00:11:44.530 --> 00:11:49.440
It's... For a split second,
I sensed an unusual form inside.

00:11:49.440 --> 00:11:52.710
We should be on our guard then.

00:11:52.710 --> 00:11:54.640
Take a look at this place.

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:57.580
You can't even compare the elder's home to this.

00:11:57.580 --> 00:12:02.880
In all likelihood, these were all taken one way or another from the villagers.

00:12:02.880 --> 00:12:05.490
That's so despicable.

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:08.250
Do you still think he'll listen to reason?

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:18.270
I still wanna know where everyone in this castle went.

00:12:18.270 --> 00:12:19.630
It just doesn't make--

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:20.620
Shh!

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:23.740
Eljuia?

00:12:23.740 --> 00:12:25.140
What is it?

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:28.410
Someone's inside.

00:12:33.650 --> 00:12:35.650
What? You guys?

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:38.120
Yo! Remember us from yesterday?

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:40.590
W-What have you come for?!

00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:44.530
S-Stay away!

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:46.660
We've just come to talk.

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:48.700
T-Talk, you say?

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:51.270
I want you to stop attacking villages.

00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:55.640
Hmph! I was wondering what you'd say, but that's it?

00:12:55.640 --> 00:13:00.040
The powerful always take from the weak.
What's wrong with that?!

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:04.510
If that continues, there's no hope in bringing peace to the kingdom!

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:09.150
Everyone fighting and hurting each other will bring the kingdom to its knees!

00:13:09.150 --> 00:13:12.720
Who do you think you are, the king?!

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:18.890
Even if I do nothing, the villagers will be at each other's throats!

00:13:18.890 --> 00:13:23.630
Everyone in the kingdom is fighting now that King Delzaine is dead.

00:13:23.630 --> 00:13:25.070
You're full of it!

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:28.330
Not everyone in this world is scum like you!

00:13:30.340 --> 00:13:33.580
P-Please! Please just don't kill me!

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:36.410
I'll do anything! I'll give you whatever you want!

00:13:36.410 --> 00:13:41.320
Chill out, man. We didn't come here to hurt you or anything.

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:44.350
Please! Please!

00:13:44.350 --> 00:13:45.820
Something's not right.

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:49.560
Agreed. He's unusually frightened about something.

00:13:49.560 --> 00:13:51.830
Stay away! Stay away!

00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:53.530
Just calm down, okay?

00:13:53.530 --> 00:13:55.760
Stay away! Stay away!

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:25.760
It's you!

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:26.530
Ibelda!

00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:28.090
You're still alive?!

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:31.600
It seems luck was on my side.

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:34.900
Impossible... He should have died in Babylon!

00:14:36.710 --> 00:14:43.040
I knew if I made havoc in Endora,
I'd run into you guys again.

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:49.080
But to think so soon, and that you'd come straight to my door!

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:58.960
Every time this wound you gave me ached, it made me happy.

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:05.330
I got excited thinking about the ways
I would kill you the next time we met.

00:15:06.500 --> 00:15:09.840
It's about time I returned the favor.

00:15:15.110 --> 00:15:18.580
Demetrio, it's just one enemy. Should we?

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:21.750
Yeah, let's shut him down. Shun! Emilio!

00:15:21.750 --> 00:15:22.920
Right!

00:15:22.920 --> 00:15:25.650
Quit your yapping!

00:15:32.930 --> 00:15:35.120
Is that all you've got?!

00:15:38.030 --> 00:15:39.470
Got him!

00:15:41.470 --> 00:15:43.670
Watch out! Get back, you two!

00:15:46.440 --> 00:15:47.540
What the hell?!

00:15:47.540 --> 00:15:48.980
That's...

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:55.650
Don't you think four on one is a little unfair?!

00:15:55.650 --> 00:15:56.520
Demetrio!

00:15:56.520 --> 00:15:59.050
His body! What's going on with it?!

00:15:59.050 --> 00:16:02.220
We all thought he was killed by Babel...

00:16:02.220 --> 00:16:06.890
Perhaps it malfunctioned and resulted in the creation of this monster.

00:16:13.840 --> 00:16:15.240
Emilio!

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:26.380
Shun! Emilio!

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:29.370
Too bad you don't have the time to help!

00:16:30.390 --> 00:16:34.360
I don't think we can talk our way out of this one.

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:39.560
So much for talking to the lord.
That didn't solve anything at all.

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:43.160
Maybe there's nothing I can do after all.

00:16:43.160 --> 00:16:44.230
You know what?!

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:49.100
If you let every little slip bring you down, you'll never make it anywhere!

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:55.680
Open your eyes! Deal with the problem in front of you first!

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:57.910
Yeah. You're right!

00:17:01.050 --> 00:17:02.450
Demetrio!

00:17:09.020 --> 00:17:13.720
New plan. I've decided the bloodbath begins with you!

00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:24.040
Don't worry. Your friends will join you soon.

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:32.080
Who's that?!

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:37.420
You...

00:17:37.420 --> 00:17:39.320
Demetrio!

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:40.750
Him?!

00:17:44.890 --> 00:17:46.460
Guidoro...

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:50.230
I never thanked you for what you did in Babylon, Ibelda.

00:17:51.400 --> 00:17:53.840
So you lived, eh, Guidoro?

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:56.340
Not that I have room to talk.

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:59.570
You must be a tough cookie, too!

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:19.290
Are you all right, Demetrio?

00:18:19.290 --> 00:18:20.430
Yeah.

00:18:20.430 --> 00:18:22.330
What are these things?

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:34.480
Hey, Guidoro. King Delzaine's dead, so the Truculent are no more.

00:18:34.480 --> 00:18:40.050
You lost your crew and your boss, so what the hell are you fighting for?!

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:45.950
It's true. My original purpose and reason to fight and live is now gone.

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:52.290
But by killing your own comrades, you've fueled my anger and eternal hatred!

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:54.730
That's enough reason for me to keep fighting!

00:19:06.740 --> 00:19:09.240
You put up a good fight, Guidoro.

00:19:09.240 --> 00:19:12.380
I think I better call it a day.

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:13.810
See you!

00:19:17.650 --> 00:19:23.390
Someday I will finish you, even if I have to chase you to the end of the world.

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:26.360
Allow me to thank you.

00:19:26.360 --> 00:19:28.760
It could've been bad if you hadn't come.

00:19:28.760 --> 00:19:31.570
I didn't come here to save you.

00:19:31.570 --> 00:19:34.900
That doesn't change the fact that you did.

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:38.270
Where are you headed?

00:19:38.270 --> 00:19:39.670
Who knows.

00:19:39.670 --> 00:19:42.910
If you don't know, why don't you come with us?

00:19:45.750 --> 00:19:48.750
How about fighting together, Guidoro?

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:50.720
Do you know what you're saying?

00:19:50.720 --> 00:19:57.530
I've always fought against the Ignauts.
I've killed countless of your kind.

00:19:57.530 --> 00:20:00.060
Of course I know that.

00:20:00.060 --> 00:20:04.060
I also know you're an honorable and talented warrior.

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:10.610
No matter what, I must end Ibelda with my own hands.

00:20:10.610 --> 00:20:13.980
If I join you, it's for that purpose only.

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:15.540
Are you fine with that?

00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:16.740
You know it.

00:20:16.740 --> 00:20:21.220
My goodness. It'll be some commotion when we all return.

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:22.220
Hmm?

00:20:22.220 --> 00:20:26.450
It's enough that everyone's worried for our safety.

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:29.390
But when they see our new comrade...

00:20:30.390 --> 00:20:31.390
I can't wait.

00:20:31.390 --> 00:20:36.100
Don't worry, man!
I'll put in a good word or two for you!

00:20:36.100 --> 00:20:41.240
I'll tell 'em you might look scary, but deep down inside, you're a really good guy.

00:20:41.240 --> 00:20:43.940
Who do you think you are anyway?

00:20:43.940 --> 00:20:49.480
Since you just joined the Ignauts, that makes me your senior, Guidoro!

00:20:49.480 --> 00:20:54.120
If you ever need anything or they're not treating you like one of the crew,

00:20:54.120 --> 00:20:55.810
you know who to come to!

00:20:58.090 --> 00:21:00.750
--Welcome to the team, Guidoro!

00:20:58.850 --> 00:21:00.750
--He's such a pain...

00:21:01.920 --> 00:21:04.860
"To be continued..."

00:21:05.260 --> 00:21:13.700
<i>I've walked very far, so far</i>

00:21:13.700 --> 00:21:23.200
<i>And I'll walk even farther from here</i>

00:21:39.230 --> 00:21:46.000
<i>I don't wish for everything to stay the same</i>

00:21:46.000 --> 00:21:56.000
<i>Because change is what got me to where I am</i>

00:21:56.640 --> 00:22:05.190
<i>We've walked very far, so far</i>

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:13.760
<i>We'll go farther than anyone's gone before</i>

00:22:13.760 --> 00:22:22.340
<i>Each of us can change the world</i>

00:22:22.340 --> 00:22:31.510
<i>That's why I smile at you</i>
